        "subject": "LU-20740 kernel: RHEL 9.9 server support",
        "message": "LU-20740 kernel: RHEL 9.9 server support\n\nThis patch makes changes to support RHEL 9.9 release\nwith kernel 5.14.0-741.22.1.el9_9 for Lustre server.\n\nRHEL 9.9 moves d_alias in struct dentry into an anonymous\nunion, so add rhel9.9/ext4-lookup-dotdot.patch using\ndentry->d_alias instead of dentry->d_u.d_alias.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testlist=sanity\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial fstype=zfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testlist=sanity\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-part-1\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-part-2\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=ldiskfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-part-3\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=zfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-zfs-part-1\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=zfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-zfs-part-2\n\nTest-Parameters: optional fstype=zfs mdtcount=4 mdscount=2 \\\n  clientdistro=el9.9 serverdistro=el9.9 testgroup=full-dne-zfs-part-3\n\nSigned-off-by: Jian Yu <yujian@nvidia.com>\nAssisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5-5\nChange-Id: Ibe6a9ea15eeebfd86bb8926d06f993bcab8287e1\n"
      },
